  "controlsRationale": "Original cursor starts576/432 and applies mouse speeds at timer boundaries. Use relative Move gesture plus separate Select; direct touch is deliberately not enabled. P/M/J remain held together for the original chord challenge. Original middle click maps to Stop timer, original right click to Finish drawing, and left/right arrow pad to Reaction movement. Auto orientation avoids unnecessary portrait hint overlap. Pending packet motion is now accumulated at original cursor handler sites, so multiple packets before a frame and stationary button packets preserve normal travel.",
